  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Out Sustainable Solid Waste and Wastewater Management to Improve Public Helath and Environment and Strengthen COVID-19 Recovery in Fast-Growing Cities in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacity on Green City Development and Mainstreaming green growth into 4 Provincial Socio-Economic Development Plans, Establishing and Scaling up Decentralized Waste Collection Service (DEWACS) and Waste Recovery Facilities in Vientiane Capital and Vang Vieng, Expanding decentralized wastewater treatment approach and improving wastewater service delivery framework in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To accelerate the transition to a low-carbon economy, improving public health for urban and peri-urban residents,creating new green jobs for workers affectedby COVID-19 and mobilizing green investment in support of a net zero future.&#xb179;&#xc0c9;&#xc131;&#xc7a5; &#xad00;&#xb828; &#xd22c;&#xc790;&#xc720;&#xce58; &#xbc0f; Seed funding&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xb179;&#xc0c9; &#xc77c;&#xc790;&#xb9ac; &#xcc3d;&#xcd9c;, &#xd3d0;&#xae30;&#xbb3c;&#xcc98;&#xb9ac;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xad00;&#xb9ac;/&#xc218;&#xac70; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xd655;&#xc0b0;,  &#xd558;&#xc218;&#xcc98;&#xb9ac; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xd558;&#xc218; &#xbc0f; &#xbd84;&#xb1e8;&#xc2ac;&#xb7ec;&#xc9c0; &#xcc98;&#xb9ac;&#xc2dc;&#xc124; &#xd655;&#xc0b0;</narrative>
